   325	    - With only a few large pieces, brute-force orientation search is feasible, but red-port matching alone is not enough.
   326	    - The anchor supplies a mirror axis, so the correct orientation choices are exactly the ones that allow a complete red-port assembly whose finished canvas reflects left-to-right.
